# Homework 2 - Model Interpretability with Anchors, SHAP, LIME, and Counterfactuals

This assignment uses the `loan_dataset.xlsx` dataset to explain and interpret loan approval decisions.

## Objectives
- Work with loan applicant financial and demographic data
- Select one approved and one denied loan application
- Generate Anchors explanations for both instances
- Create SHAP explanations for the same instances
- Create LIME explanations for the same instances
- Select two denied loan applications
- Generate counterfactual explanations for both denied cases
- Compare multiple explainability methods for model decisions

## Files
- Jupyter Notebook containing the explainability analysis
- `loan_dataset.xlsx`
